{"_note":"首页:待办三桶(各 10 条)+ 关注的仓库,**一条 GraphQL** 取完(cost 1~2 点)。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n页面自己做格式化(相对时间 / 状态标签)—— H5 有完整的 JS,不必在流里把每一行展开成表达式。\n输出平行数组(VParser 没有 map),页面按下标 zip。\nG23 三态缓存由 tools/infosource/wrap_cache.py 套上,键 = 凭证指纹 + 关注位签名。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"id":"cred","action":"credential.state","params":{"id":"gh"},"_note":"零网络查绑定表。`fp` 换绑即变,拼进缓存键 —— 否则换了账号,首屏会先渲出上一个账号的待办。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cst","value":"$[connect::(${cred.state},)]"},"_note":"凭证状态(bound / unbound / expired)。⚠️ **不进缓存**:它由生成器在三态包装之后单独补进 resultFilter —— 缓存出口会把包里每个字段都从盘上读回来,令牌失效了首屏还说「已绑定」就是撒谎。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"fp","value":"$[connect::(${cred.fp},)]"}},{"id":"slots","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"gh_slots","default":[]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_sb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o0","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[0].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"},"_note":"只留 GitHub 用户名 / 仓库名合法的字符:这两个值会原样拼进 GraphQL 查询,关注位可能来自导入的备份,不过滤就是一个查询注入面。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n0","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[0].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o1","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[1].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n1","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[1].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o2","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[2].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n2","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[2].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o3","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[3].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n3","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[3].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o4","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[4].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n4","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[4].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o5","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[5].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n5","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[5].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_ns","value":["$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o0}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o1}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o2}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o3}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o4}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o5}),k),0,1)]"]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nsb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nS","value":"$[sum::(${_ns})]"},"_note":"关注位个数。先落成数组再 sum —— if 的数字输出直接进 calc 不可靠。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasS","value":"$[if::(gt::(${nS},0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"slotSig","value":"$[connect::(${o0}/${n0};,${o1}/${n1};,${o2}/${n2};,${o3}/${n3};,${o4}/${n4};,${o5}/${n5};)]"},"_note":"关注位也进缓存键:加 / 删一个仓库之后,首屏不能先渲出旧的那组。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_S","value":"${_nw}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_a","value":"$[if::(le::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7),2),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_Y","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},0,4)-${_nw_a})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_M","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7)+12*${_nw_a}-3)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_t","value":"$[calc::((365*${_nw_Y}+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%4)/4-(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%100)/100+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%400)/400+((153*${_nw_M}+2)-(153*${_nw_M}+2)%5)/5+subString::(${_nw_S},8,10)-1-719468)*86400000+subString::(${_nw_S},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${_nw_S},14,16)*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_tm","value":"$[calc::(${t0}-${t0}%60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"off","value":"$[calc::(${_nw_t}-${_tm})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_H","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},HH)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_M","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"E0","value":"$[calc::(${_tm}-${_H}*3600000-${_M}*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_ao","value":"$[if::(ge::(${off},0),${off},calc::(0-${off}))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_oh","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}-${_ao}%3600000)/3600000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_om","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}%3600000)/60000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"TZ","value":"$[connect::(if::(ge::(${off},0),+,-),if::(lt::(${_oh},10),connect::(0,${_oh}),${_oh}),:,if::(lt::(${_om},10),connect::(0,${_om}),${_om}))]"},"_note":"时区偏移串 ±HH:MM。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S0","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-0*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd0","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-0*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S1","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-1*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd1","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-1*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S2","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-2*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd2","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-2*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S3","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-3*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd3","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-3*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S4","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-4*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd4","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-4*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S5","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-5*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd5","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-5*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S6","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-6*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd6","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-6*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S7","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-7*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S8","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-8*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S9","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-9*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S10","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-10*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S11","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-11*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S12","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-12*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S13","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-13*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"_note":"入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。","op":"set","props":{"key":"cacheIn","value":"${_cache}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"useCache","value":"$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"}},{"_note":"**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。","op":"set","props":{"key":"SCHEMA","value":"$[connect::(s3.,md5_16::(${slotSig}))]"}},{"_note":"缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。","op":"set","props":{"key":"ckey","value":"$[connect::(c.gh.home.,${fp})]"}},{"_note":"读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。","id":"hit","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"${ckey}","default":{}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hitSchema","value":"${hit.schema}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nowMs","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hitTs","value":"$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"age","value":"$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"}},{"_note":"两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 86400s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。","op":"set","props":{"key":"hasHit","value":"$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},86400000),1,0),0),0)]"}},{"_note":"ttl = 300s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。","op":"set","props":{"key":"fresh","value":"$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},300000),1,0),0)]"}},{"_note":"「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。","op":"set","props":{"key":"_stale","value":"$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"}},{"_note":"只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"},"items":[{"_note":"没绑 / 已过期就不发请求 —— 页面据 cst 画绑定引导,不白打一个必然 401 的请求。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${cst},bound),1,0)]"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{viewer{login avatarUrl} rv:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr user-review-requested:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:10){issueCount nodes{...on PullRequest{title number url createdAt updatedAt additions deletions comments{totalCount} author{login} repository{nameWithOwner}}}} ro:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr user-review-requested:@me archived:false sort:created-asc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:1){nodes{...on PullRequest{createdAt title number repository{nameWithOwner}}}} my:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr author:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:10){issueCount nodes{...on PullRequest{title number url updatedAt isDraft reviewDecision mergeable additions deletions comments{totalCount} latestOpinionatedReviews(first:2){nodes{state author{login}}} repository{nameWithOwner} statusCheckRollup{state contexts(first:0){totalCount checkRunCountsByState{state count} statusContextCountsByState{state count}}}}}} as:search(query:\\\"is:open is:issue assignee:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:10){issueCount nodes{...on Issue{title number url updatedAt repository{nameWithOwner}}}} viewer{login repositories(first:6,orderBy:{field:PUSHED_AT,direction:DESC},ownerAffiliations:[OWNER],isFork:false,isArchived:false){nodes{nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}}}} r0:repository(owner:\\\"${o0}\\\",name:\\\"${n0}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r1:repository(owner:\\\"${o1}\\\",name:\\\"${n1}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r2:repository(owner:\\\"${o2}\\\",name:\\\"${n2}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r3:repository(owner:\\\"${o3}\\\",name:\\\"${n3}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r4:repository(owner:\\\"${o4}\\\",name:\\\"${n4}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r5:repository(owner:\\\"${o5}\\\",name:\\\"${n5}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} act:viewer{repositories(first:6,orderBy:{field:PUSHED_AT,direction:DESC},ownerAffiliations:[OWNER],isFork:false,isArchived:false){nodes{nameWithOwner url defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{d0:history(since:\\\"${S0}\\\"){totalCount} d1:history(since:\\\"${S1}\\\",until:\\\"${S0}\\\"){totalCount} d2:history(since:\\\"${S2}\\\",until:\\\"${S1}\\\"){totalCount} d3:history(since:\\\"${S3}\\\",until:\\\"${S2}\\\"){totalCount} d4:history(since:\\\"${S4}\\\",until:\\\"${S3}\\\"){totalCount} d5:history(since:\\\"${S5}\\\",until:\\\"${S4}\\\"){totalCount} d6:history(since:\\\"${S6}\\\",until:\\\"${S5}\\\"){totalCount} pw:history(since:\\\"${S13}\\\",until:\\\"${S6}\\\"){totalCount} last:history(first:3){nodes{messageHeadline committedDate additions deletions url}}}}}}}}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(or::(eq::(connect::(k,${login}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.rv.issueCount}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.my.issueCount}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.as.issueCount}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.act.repositories.nodes}),k)),0,1)]"},"_note":"判据是 **viewer 有没有回来**,不是任何计数:待办恰好全是 0 是好消息,拿计数判会把「今天很干净」误判成「没取到」。⚠️ 用 `connect::(k,…)` 哨兵拼串再比 —— `eq` 是数字化比较,`eq::(0,)` 恒真(todo.df 2026-08-26 栽过)。\n⚠️ 还要求本条流用到的每一段都回来了(need):GraphQL 部分超时会只让某几个 search 为 null、viewer 照常返回 —— 只看 viewer 会把「没取到」渲成「都处理完了」,提醒也会判假而不是未知(2026-09-25 审查实